%%{init: { 'sequence': { 'actorMargin': 40 } } }%%

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as Edge App
    participant C as GEISA Platform<br/>(LwM2M Client)
    participant S as GEISA EMS<br/>(LwM2M Server)
    participant V as Vendor Application Server


    Note over A,C: GEISA MQTT API
    A->>C: App Subscribes to GEISA<br/>API topic (app config)
    C-->>A: SUBACK

    Note over V,S: HTTPS / ReST
    V->>S: POST application<br/>message (CONFIG)
    S-->>V: 202 Accepted

    Note over C,S: LwM2M / DTLS
    S->>C: PUT /3600/x/0<br/>(App Config)
    C-->>S: 2.04 Changed

    C->>A: Platform Publishes topic<br/>(app config) to App
    A-->>C: PUBACK

    A->>A: App reloads config<br/>
